{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Circle is a roguelite top-down shooter with vector-graphics reminiscent of old arcade classics from a time before pixels. Make sense of the mayhem using the <strong>ultra-crisp visuals</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo contains the first two stages of the first world and a limited portion of the metaprogression. Development of this game is on-going, so please leave feedback!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/994380d53fadd261f0126eb64f6dce29.poster.avif?t=1756841817\" width=614 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/994380d53fadd261f0126eb64f6dce29.webm?t=1756841817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/994380d53fadd261f0126eb64f6dce29.mp4?t=1756841817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Circle, a circular vessel equipped with <strong>upgradable active and passive abilities</strong>. Gather XP by defeating hordes of clever enemies and level up to upgrade these abilities and become unstoppable. Then, make your way through the <strong>procedurally generated levels</strong> to find dangerous bosses and vanquish them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/5557fd41c7c5579811f467f8ce4745df.poster.avif?t=1756841817\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/5557fd41c7c5579811f467f8ce4745df.webm?t=1756841817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/5557fd41c7c5579811f467f8ce4745df.mp4?t=1756841817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather coins to to upgrade Circle in the meta-progression outside of runs to become even stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actively control up to 4 abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35+ active &amp; passive unlockable abilities to get during runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65+ permanent upgrades to Circle in the survivors-like meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ milestones that  unlock new features</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947010?t=1756841817","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947010?t=1756841817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/94340a1ea8098c202daca6cb5ee516982f571a07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756841817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/94340a1ea8098c202daca6cb5ee516982f571a07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756841817","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Circle is a roguelite top-down shooter with vector-graphics reminiscent of old arcade classics from a time before pixels. Make sense of the mayhem using the <strong>ultra-crisp visuals</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo contains the first two stages of the first world and a limited portion of the metaprogression. Development of this game is on-going, so please leave feedback!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/994380d53fadd261f0126eb64f6dce29.poster.avif?t=1756841817\" width=614 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/994380d53fadd261f0126eb64f6dce29.webm?t=1756841817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/994380d53fadd261f0126eb64f6dce29.mp4?t=1756841817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Circle, a circular vessel equipped with <strong>upgradable active and passive abilities</strong>. Gather XP by defeating hordes of clever enemies and level up to upgrade these abilities and become unstoppable. Then, make your way through the <strong>procedurally generated levels</strong> to find dangerous bosses and vanquish them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/5557fd41c7c5579811f467f8ce4745df.poster.avif?t=1756841817\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/5557fd41c7c5579811f467f8ce4745df.webm?t=1756841817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947010/extras/5557fd41c7c5579811f467f8ce4745df.mp4?t=1756841817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather coins to to upgrade Circle in the meta-progression outside of runs to become even stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\